{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"747287820221284362","content":"So I'm thinking that each of the 'backgrounds' are more like what you do when you arrive at the city (what job you take up). Since everyone is immigrants, I'm thinking the backgrounds should have less features than normal backgrounds do and everyone should have 2 or so features cuz they're an immigrant","created_at":"2020-08-24T20:28:10.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747552859108671541","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
